{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive. Adapt. Overcome.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the Vietnam War through the eyes of a stranded soldier, fighting to survive deep in the jungle after a helicopter crash. Cut off from HQ, you must find your own path back -\u00a0<strong>alone or with your team.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE BEHIND ENEMY LINES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your approach -\u00a0<strong>silent and precise or loud and destructive.</strong><br>Plan ambushes, infiltrate villages, sabotage enemy camps, and fight through intense combat zones. Every decision counts in this unforgiving tactical sandbox.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY YOUR WAY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full campaign playable solo or in 4-player coop</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic AI</strong> reacting to your tactics and noise</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open mission areas</strong> offering total freedom of approach</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MULTIPLAYER &amp; PROGRESSION</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in <strong>competitive PvP and Coop</strong> battles with vehicles and infantry</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cross-platform play</strong> with shared stats and unlocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn weapons, attachments, and upgrades through progression</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CREATE. SHARE. FIGHT.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Integrated Sandbox Editor</strong>\u00a0- create and share your own missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully supports <strong>Singleplayer, Coop, and PvP</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cross-platform UGC</strong> ensures all players can play together</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond Enemy Lines - 